  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant used printing equipment and blank invoices to illegally produce and sell invoices that can be used for tax deduction, as well as other invoices that cannot be used for export tax refunds or tax deductions. These actions correspond to the statutory offense of illegally manufacturing and selling invoices for tax purposes. Because two distinct categories of invoices are involved (those for tax deduction and those not for export tax refund), the prosecution seeks separate charges for each category. Therefore, the appropriate crimes are illegal manufacturing and selling of invoices for tax deduction, and illegal manufacturing and selling of other invoices that cannot be used for export tax refunds or tax deductions.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法制造、出售用于抵扣税款发票罪;非法制造、出售不能用于骗取出口退税、抵扣税款的其他发票罪<eoa>"
